@AccountService.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:8082

### Perfil propio
GET {{AccountService.API_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Editar perfil propio
PUT {{AccountService.API_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Rubén",
  "bio": "Montañero de fin de semana.",
  "countryCode": "ES",
  "visibility": "Public"
}

### Cambiar slug
PUT {{AccountService.API_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/me/slug
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "ruben-fer"
}

### Perfil público por id
GET {{AccountService.API_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/{{userId}}

### Perfil público por slug
GET {{AccountService.API_HostAddress}}/api/profiles/by-slug/ruben-fer

###
